Adaptive Shells
Copyright (c) 2026 Zhaorong Wang

An unofficial implementation of Adaptive Shells for Efficient Neural Radiance
Field Rendering, Zian Wang et al., SIGGRAPH Asia 2023.
https://research.nvidia.com/labs/toronto-ai/adaptive-shells/

Training is derived from SDFStudio (https://github.com/autonomousvision/sdfstudio)
and Nerfstudio (https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/nerfstudio).
Copyright 2022 The Nerfstudio Team. All rights reserved.
Their Apache-2.0 license and source-file notices are retained.
Modifications include adaptive-shell training, shell extraction and tracing,
predicted-gradient fine-tuning, and checkpoint compatibility.

The renderer's legacy_field.py adapts the SDFStudio/Nerfstudio neural-field
structure for checkpoint loading and retains Apache-2.0. Original renderer
code is available under renderer/LICENSE (MIT).

